    <feedback>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[I am Commander Shirish Deshpande, retired from Indian Navy after 20 years of service. Later I joined Merchant Navy and sailed as a Captain till June 2021. In 2017, First time I met Master Pradeep Vijay in Meditation Retreat which was life changing. I regularly attend online/ offline retreats and seminars conducted by Master Pradeep Vijay which helps me to understand life and dive deeper into self while meditating. Best wishes to Pradeep Sir to inspire more and more people on Self- Realization path.]]></Value>
    </feedback>
